source_cn:
基于伤害类型，抵消攻击来源物理暴击或魔法暴击，降低角色受到相应类型暴击伤害的概率（命中后的暴击率不会低于5%）。

角色抗物理暴击：{*d,F1690001,pCritAnti}
角色抗魔法暴击：{*d,F1690001,mCritAnti}

ref_en:
Based on the damage type, negates the attack source's physical critical hit or magic critical hit, reducing the probability of the character receiving the corresponding type of critical damage (the critical hit rate after hitting will not be lower than 5%). 

 Character Physical Critical Resistance: {*d,F1690001,pCritAnti} 
 Character Magic Critical Resistance: {*d,F1690001,mCritAnti}

none: No target required; 
 owner: The originator of the skill and buff; 
 tar: The target of the skill and buff; 
 tarlist: Targets in the blackboard.
